---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site-config";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="sr-only">
      Specializing in offensive and defensive security with expertise across multiple domains.
      My focus areas include Ethical Hacking, Digital Forensics, Cryptography, and SOC operations.
      Committed to continuous learning and security excellence.
    </p>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="text-sm font-light">
      <p class="text-sm font-light">
        Cybersecurity professional based in {SITE.location.countryName}.
      </p>
      <br />
      Specializations:
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Ethical Hacking & Penetration Testing</li>
        <li>Digital Forensics & Incident Response</li>
        <li>Cryptography & Security Research</li>
        <li>SOC Operations & Threat Analysis</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm font-light mt-2">
        Dedicated to advancing cybersecurity through hands-on experience and continuous skill development.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Card>
